WEBVTT

00:05.940 --> 00:07.610
<b><i>Past 2 a.m.</i></b>

00:09.440 --> 00:11.610
<b><i>My apartment, where I live alone.</i></b>

00:12.490 --> 00:16.490
<b>COLD COMPRESS
COLD PACK</b>

00:17.830 --> 00:20.450
<b><i>A high school boy who's my gaming friend.</i></b>

00:25.500 --> 00:26.330
<b><i>And...</i></b>

00:26.750 --> 00:29.130
<b><i>me with my 100-degree fever.</i></b>

02:08.020 --> 02:11.020
<b>Episode 11: There's Something
I Want To Talk To You About</b>

02:09.140 --> 02:12.110
<b>I was dead to the world last night, see.</b>

02:12.110 --> 02:14.280
<b>Sorry I didn't notice your calls.</b>

02:14.280 --> 02:17.780
<b>RICE PRINCESS</b>

02:14.780 --> 02:17.320
<b>Is this enough to keep you going
for about a week?</b>

02:19.820 --> 02:22.530
<b>Momo, you're truly a goddess!</b>

02:19.820 --> 02:22.530
<b>BAWL</b>

02:22.950 --> 02:26.950
<b>But, hey, Akane, having a fever
really knocks you flat, huh?</b>

02:27.330 --> 02:29.040
<b>GET SOME TRAINING IN...</b>

02:27.450 --> 02:29.670
<b>You just don't have any basic stamina.</b>

02:29.040 --> 02:31.540
<b>GET THE COLD STUFF OUT</b>

02:29.420 --> 02:31.540
<b>OKAY</b>

02:30.330 --> 02:31.830
<b>Did you go to the hospital?</b>

02:31.830 --> 02:35.670
<b>Uh, yeah. Yamada took me to a clinic
that was open late.</b>

02:36.420 --> 02:38.050
<b>I'm going back there tomorrow.</b>

02:38.050 --> 02:40.430
<b>WHOA, THERE'S MEAT, TOO</b>

02:40.760 --> 02:41.930
<b>Huh?</b>

02:41.930 --> 02:45.180
<b>Oh, you see, Yamada came
to check on me last night, and—</b>

02:45.180 --> 02:46.020
<b>Huh?</b>

02:46.930 --> 02:49.640
<b>Have you been dating behind my back?</b>

02:49.640 --> 02:52.060
<b>Of course not! We're just friends.</b>

02:52.060 --> 02:53.650
<b>He really is a great guy.</b>

02:54.190 --> 02:57.400
<b>Um, what? Doesn't that mean...</b>

02:59.450 --> 03:02.410
<b>MERCY</b>

02:59.530 --> 03:01.660
<b><i>Oh, well,
I'll wait 'til you're well again.</i></b>

03:03.740 --> 03:05.660
<b>So that's about it for today.</b>

03:06.240 --> 03:07.620
<b>Okay, I'm out of here.</b>

03:08.080 --> 03:10.790
<b>Thanks! Wait here while I get my wallet.</b>

03:13.580 --> 03:18.010
<b><i>Would a man do that much
for a woman he's not in love with?</i></b>

03:18.510 --> 03:22.720
<b><i>That's what I think. But I don't know
anything about Yamada's personality.</i></b>

03:23.220 --> 03:24.800
<b><i>As for Akane, because she got dumped,</i></b>

03:24.800 --> 03:27.680
<b><i>it seems like she won't be
falling in love again anytime soon.</i></b>

03:25.430 --> 03:28.180
<b>STARE</b>

03:28.220 --> 03:29.680
<b>WELL, NOT THAT I CAN BLAME HER...</b>

03:30.560 --> 03:33.060
<b>I'M GIVING YOU A LITTLE EXTRA!</b>

03:32.060 --> 03:33.060
<b>HMM</b>

03:33.060 --> 03:34.480
<b>Okay, I'm heading out,</b>

03:34.480 --> 03:37.530
<b>but, Akane, let me know right away
if anything happens.</b>

03:37.530 --> 03:38.360
<b>Sure!</b>

03:41.490 --> 03:42.320
<b>Huh?</b>

03:42.990 --> 03:45.530
<b>Also, timing's everything
when it comes to love.</b>

03:47.120 --> 03:49.950
<b>Uh, right. That's true.</b>

03:50.250 --> 03:52.790
<b>As long as you get that, fine. See you!</b>

04:12.520 --> 04:15.100
<b>THANKS SO MUCH
FOR TODAY
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?</b>

04:12.520 --> 04:15.100
<b>READ</b>

04:12.520 --> 04:15.100
<b>SORRY, I JUST SAW THIS
I'M FINE</b>

04:16.360 --> 04:18.480
<b>AT LEAST THAT'S GOOD NEWS...</b>

04:19.360 --> 04:21.690
<b><i>I'll thank him properly when I'm better.</i></b>

04:22.490 --> 04:23.740
<b><i>What should I do?</i></b>

04:23.740 --> 04:25.450
<b>AKITO YAMADA
MOMOKO MAEDA
AYU
RURIHIME
MOTHER
RUNA</b>

04:35.040 --> 04:36.710
<b><i>How's your cold?</i></b>

04:36.710 --> 04:39.090
<b><i>I can log in this weekend if you want!</i></b>

04:39.090 --> 04:41.300
<b><i>Let's play together
when you're well again!</i></b>

04:41.300 --> 04:44.010
<b>SOB</b>

04:41.300 --> 04:44.010
<b>I MISS YOU</b>

04:42.300 --> 04:44.010
<b><i>Runa!</i></b>

04:44.680 --> 04:48.140
<b><i>Come to think of it,
did Runa log in yesterday?</i></b>

04:48.680 --> 04:51.720
<b><i>We were going to introduce ourselves
to the new player,</i></b>

04:51.720 --> 04:54.480
<b><i>but I still haven't met her yet.</i></b>

04:55.690 --> 04:58.650
<b><i>I'm worn out from studying,
so maybe I'll play a little FOS.</i></b>

05:01.150 --> 05:06.110
<b><i>Runa and Yamada won't be there,
but how about Rurihime and Mr. Kamota?</i></b>

05:06.110 --> 05:07.910
<b><i>It would be great to go hunting with them!</i></b>

05:09.370 --> 05:16.870
<b>SYSTEM: AKANE IS ONLINE</b>

05:10.870 --> 05:15.290
<b><i>I haven't been leveling up much lately,
so I want to get a lot done today!</i></b>

05:15.290 --> 05:16.870
<b>Hey, it's Akanecchi!</b>

05:18.250 --> 05:19.080
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

05:22.050 --> 05:24.590
<b><i>It's the rumored new player!</i></b>

05:24.590 --> 05:27.510
<b>This is our new guild member, TSUBAKI!</b>

05:28.390 --> 05:31.890
<b>Nice to meet you! I'm Akane!
I'm a Level 55 Paladin!</b>

05:32.390 --> 05:34.980
<b>I'm TSUBAKI. Nice to meet you.</b>

05:35.430 --> 05:37.520
<b>I'm a newbie who just started playing FOS.</b>

05:37.900 --> 05:42.070
<b>I was just asking TSUBAKI to join me
for some map reconnaissance,</b>

05:42.070 --> 05:44.990
<b>but since you're here, Akanecchi,
maybe we should all go hunting?</b>

05:44.990 --> 05:46.110
<b>I want to go!</b>

05:46.110 --> 05:50.780
<b>Huh? Um... I still have no clue
about my attacks, though,</b>

05:50.780 --> 05:52.160
<b>so I'd only get in your way.</b>

05:52.490 --> 05:55.910
<b>If you want to learn about Paladin moves,
Akanecchi can show you!</b>

05:56.080 --> 05:57.960
<b>So you're a Paladin, too, TSUBAKI?</b>

05:58.460 --> 06:00.330
<b>Are most players in the Mage Class?</b>

05:59.170 --> 06:00.920
<b>THAT'S RIGHT</b>

06:01.670 --> 06:04.170
<b>NO</b>

06:01.960 --> 06:05.880
<b>There are only wizards
with demonic firepower here.</b>

06:04.170 --> 06:05.420
<b>NO
NO</b>

06:05.420 --> 06:17.690
<b>NO
NO
NO</b>

06:05.550 --> 06:17.690
<b>CRAWL...</b>

06:05.880 --> 06:09.010
<b>Not only that, but everyone
has higher DEF than me.</b>

06:09.010 --> 06:13.600
<b>There are times when I wonder
why I chose this Job Class.</b>

06:14.100 --> 06:17.180
<b>I mean, doesn't it say
that it's recommended for newbies?</b>

06:17.980 --> 06:21.610
<b>Still, I think that at the higher levels,
Paladins can be powerful.</b>

06:21.610 --> 06:30.110
<b>I'VE DONE MY RESEARCH</b>

06:22.060 --> 06:25.780
<b>Only Paladins can challenge
the end content's bosses.</b>

06:26.280 --> 06:29.110
<b>I like it, because it seems
like it can be rewarding.</b>

06:29.110 --> 06:31.450
<b>Ah!</b>

06:30.570 --> 06:32.320
<b>WELL, PEOPLE'S THOUGHT PROCESSES
ARE ALL DIFFERENT</b>

06:31.450 --> 06:32.580
<b><i>What a great girl!</i></b>

06:33.120 --> 06:35.410
<b>But I did hear
that the attacks are hard to master.</b>

06:35.410 --> 06:36.330
<b>Don't worry!</b>

06:36.330 --> 06:37.660
<b>Leave it to me!</b>

06:38.160 --> 06:39.960
<b><i>I have to show her what I'm made of!</i></b>

06:40.710 --> 06:43.340
<b><i>I have to make sure
that I don't drag her down.</i></b>

06:44.210 --> 06:47.720
<b>Mom! Runa can't find her doughnuts!</b>

06:48.510 --> 06:50.510
<b>Okay, then shall we head out?</b>

06:50.510 --> 06:52.550
<b>Is everyone's equipment okay?</b>

06:52.550 --> 06:53.430
<b>Yes.</b>

06:53.430 --> 06:55.140
<b>And yes.</b>

07:02.020 --> 07:03.810
<b>The sky's so beautiful!</b>

07:05.230 --> 07:09.360
<b>I really like the graphics for this sky!</b>

07:09.860 --> 07:12.450
<b>I think it might be
my favorite part of FOS!</b>

07:13.660 --> 07:15.240
<b>What do you two think?</b>

07:18.000 --> 07:20.290
<b>NOT THE TIME</b>

07:18.000 --> 07:20.500
<b>We're a little busy right now!</b>

07:20.500 --> 07:23.500
<b>NO TIME FOR THAT
WHATSOEVER</b>

07:20.500 --> 07:23.500
<b>- Strike! Strike! Strike! Strike!
- Shield! Shield!</b>

07:28.090 --> 07:31.340
<b>Anyway, can't you give us a hand
instead of taking in the scenery?</b>

07:31.340 --> 07:33.010
<b>This enemy refuses to die!</b>

07:33.010 --> 07:36.260
<b>If I were to attack it,
it would mean instant death!</b>

07:36.760 --> 07:39.270
<b>It's not that strong of a boss,
so give it all you've got!</b>

07:39.270 --> 07:40.730
<b>You've got to be kidding me!</b>

07:39.730 --> 07:44.270
<b>BRUTAL DEMETAL</b>

07:40.730 --> 07:44.270
<b>He's got so much HP,
there are four whole bars!</b>

07:44.480 --> 07:45.310
<b>NORMAL ENEMY</b>

07:44.480 --> 07:45.560
<b>DEMETAL</b>

07:45.560 --> 07:47.270
<b>EVIL DEMETAL</b>

07:47.270 --> 07:49.280
<b>BRUTAL DEMETAL</b>

07:50.530 --> 07:53.910
<b>The damage you're both dealing
is less than the enemy's healing ability!</b>

07:53.910 --> 07:55.030
<b>So interesting!</b>

07:55.030 --> 07:57.030
<b>RURIHIME JUST EARNED THE HATRED OF TWO PALADINS!</b>

07:55.030 --> 07:57.030
<b>ANNOYED</b>

07:57.490 --> 07:59.160
<b>Hey, here it comes!</b>

07:59.330 --> 08:00.160
<b>Damn it!</b>

08:00.160 --> 08:03.120
<b>Strike! Strike! Strike! Strike!</b>

08:01.580 --> 08:02.410
<b><i>But...</i></b>

08:02.410 --> 08:08.050
<b>BRUTAL DEMETAL</b>

08:03.120 --> 08:04.920
<b>Strike! Strike! Strike...</b>

08:04.920 --> 08:08.050
<b>NATURAL HEALING</b>

08:06.540 --> 08:08.050
<b><i>it's true that...</i></b>

08:08.170 --> 08:10.050
<b><i>this is getting us nowhere!</i></b>

08:08.170 --> 08:10.550
<b>Strike! Strike! Strike! Strike!</b>

08:10.760 --> 08:14.300
<b><i>Thanks to the master's recovery magic,
we're not going to die, but...</i></b>

08:19.850 --> 08:22.690
<b><i>This is shredding our morale!</i></b>

08:23.230 --> 08:25.440
<b>If you make a few adjustments,</b>

08:25.440 --> 08:28.440
<b>you two can totally subdue
this boss at your level!</b>

08:28.650 --> 08:29.610
<b>Huh?</b>

08:29.610 --> 08:31.360
<b>Oh, right! I get it!</b>

08:31.360 --> 08:33.820
<b>Maybe we should mash
our skill buttons like crazy?</b>

08:33.820 --> 08:35.160
<b>Huh?</b>

08:33.820 --> 08:37.580
<b>IS THAT WHAT
SHE MEANS BY
ADJUSTMENTS!?</b>

08:35.160 --> 08:37.580
<b><i>But that's what
I've been doing.</i></b>

08:37.740 --> 08:40.450
<b>Let's give it a shot!
The "mash it to death" strategy!</b>

08:40.870 --> 08:42.080
<b>- Three, two...
- Huh?</b>

08:42.080 --> 08:47.080
<b>TAP TAP TAP</b>

08:48.670 --> 08:52.340
<b>THE MASTER REALIZES SOMETHING
DUE TO THE CHAT GOING SO SILENT</b>

08:52.340 --> 08:56.590
<b>BRUTAL DEMETAL</b>

08:53.340 --> 08:56.590
<b>ANNOYED</b>

08:58.260 --> 09:00.470
<b>They must be pounding it
like there's no tomorrow.</b>

09:00.890 --> 09:03.020
<b>Want me to give you a hint?</b>

09:03.020 --> 09:06.020
<b>Hold up.
I think I'm starting to understand.</b>

09:06.020 --> 09:06.850
<b>Seriously?</b>

09:06.230 --> 09:06.850
<b>I DON'T UNDERSTAND AT ALL!!</b>

09:07.020 --> 09:09.320
<b>Maybe. Please don't say anything yet.</b>

09:09.690 --> 09:10.900
<b>All right!</b>

09:11.360 --> 09:12.740
<b>GIVE ME A HINT</b>

09:15.280 --> 09:36.380
<b>EXPERIENCE OF 500 MILLION YEARS AGO</b>

09:36.380 --> 09:39.640
<b>TRASH</b>

09:36.510 --> 09:39.640
<b>THE BOSS LEAVES DUE TO TIME RUNNING OUT</b>

09:36.680 --> 09:38.140
<b>My fingers are dead.</b>

09:38.140 --> 09:39.140
<b>Same here.</b>

09:40.140 --> 09:43.560
<b>But we did manage to chip away a lot
in the second half.</b>

09:43.560 --> 09:47.440
<b>It was like there was
a certain window to land our attacks.</b>

09:47.440 --> 09:50.020
<b>Right, right!
Whenever he flapped his wings!</b>

09:50.480 --> 09:54.490
<b>So then maybe we should try
to inflict damage in a more efficient way?</b>

09:54.490 --> 09:56.650
<b>Then that's where
we should pepper him with skills!</b>

09:57.110 --> 10:00.120
<b>Why don't we both check our skill effects?</b>

10:00.120 --> 10:02.280
<b>Good idea.
And let's check on our equipment, too!</b>

10:03.950 --> 10:05.290
<b><i>Best of friends now!</i></b>

10:05.330 --> 10:12.590
<b>TSUBAKI > My armor's battered,
so I'm going to take a break</b>

10:09.580 --> 10:10.840
<b>Akane > I'm logging out
See you two later!</b>

10:10.840 --> 10:12.590
<b>Akane > I'm logging out
See you two later!
Rurihime > Okay! Good work, Akanecchi</b>

10:12.590 --> 10:15.800
<b>Rurihime > TSUBAKI, I'll fix your armor
for you, so let me have it</b>

10:14.340 --> 10:15.800
<b>TSUBAKI > Good work, Akane</b>

10:15.800 --> 10:18.550
<b>TSUBAKI > Good work, Akane</b>

10:16.840 --> 10:18.550
<b>TSUBAKI > I'll take it off now</b>

10:23.390 --> 10:25.350
<b><i>Akane, my guildmate...</i></b>

10:26.140 --> 10:28.690
<b><i>Meaning she's probably that Akane.</i></b>

10:30.940 --> 10:32.190
<b>SYSTEM: AKANE HAS SENT YOU
A FRIEND REQUEST</b>

10:34.070 --> 10:36.610
<b><i>She was easy to talk to.</i></b>

10:36.690 --> 10:39.700
<b>Are you awake?</b>

10:38.650 --> 10:39.700
<b>Yes</b>

10:39.700 --> 10:46.580
<b>AKANE</b>

10:47.500 --> 10:48.330
<b>Yes? Yes.</b>

10:50.580 --> 10:51.500
<b>Yes.</b>

10:52.500 --> 10:53.340
<b>What?</b>

10:54.040 --> 10:57.460
<b>Brutal Demetal?
What are you talking about?</b>

10:57.970 --> 11:01.890
<b>The one in the first meadow
outside FOS's Town of Beginnings.</b>

11:01.890 --> 11:04.140
<b>The big enemy with four bars of HP.</b>

11:04.680 --> 11:06.890
<b>Is it a random-spawning boss?</b>

11:06.890 --> 11:10.020
<b><i>That's it! That's what Rurihime said, too!</i></b>

11:09.390 --> 11:11.850
<b>TOWN OF BEGINNINGS...</b>

11:10.020 --> 11:11.850
<b><i>Have you ever defeated that one, Yamada?</i></b>

11:14.400 --> 11:17.320
<b>I haven't battled that many bosses
in that tier.</b>

11:17.320 --> 11:21.780
<b><i>I see. I was hoping that you'd have
some strategies or something.</i></b>

11:21.780 --> 11:24.700
<b>I don't know.
If it has some kind of gimmick,</b>

11:24.700 --> 11:26.740
<b>maybe you should time your moves to it?</b>

11:26.740 --> 11:32.630
<b>BRUTAL DEMETAL</b>

11:27.040 --> 11:34.380
<b>IT'S TOO HARD!!</b>

11:27.660 --> 11:29.210
<b>Gimmick...</b>

11:28.160 --> 11:34.420
<b>GOOD LUCK</b>

11:29.710 --> 11:32.420
<b><i>Like if there's a period
when attacks are invalid.</i></b>

11:32.420 --> 11:34.000
<b>There are all kinds of patterns.</b>

11:34.500 --> 11:36.380
<b>Yes! He had one of those!</b>

11:36.800 --> 11:38.880
<b>What should I do when that happens?</b>

11:41.260 --> 11:43.340
<b>Oh, a buff!</b>

11:42.130 --> 11:43.890
<b>BUFF = STATUS BOOST</b>

11:42.380 --> 11:43.890
<b>SOUNDS BETTER
THAN MASHING
IT TO DEATH</b>

11:45.180 --> 11:47.390
<b>Do you think
you're going to like our guild?</b>

11:47.390 --> 11:53.900
<b>REPAIRING ARMOR WITH SEWING SKILLS</b>

11:48.770 --> 11:51.730
<b>Isn't Akanecchi easy to talk to?</b>

11:52.140 --> 11:53.900
<b>Uh... yes.</b>

11:54.310 --> 11:57.320
<b>Everyone's so nice.
You've really put me at ease.</b>

11:57.820 --> 12:00.150
<b>I actually feel bad about it.</b>

12:01.490 --> 12:02.660
<b>But why?</b>

12:04.240 --> 12:08.080
<b>Originally,
I had no interest in this game.</b>

12:08.910 --> 12:13.870
<b>I got myself into this guild
for a more selfish reason.</b>

12:15.080 --> 12:20.920
<b>But now I'm starting to wonder what it was
that I wanted to do in the first place.</b>

12:20.920 --> 12:24.680
<b>SO DARK</b>

12:21.090 --> 12:24.680
<b>A-Are you okay? I'd be happy
to hear all about it if you want.</b>

12:29.680 --> 12:33.190
<b>There's nothing</b>

12:31.430 --> 12:33.190
<b>that I can tell you.</b>

12:35.690 --> 12:38.320
<b><i>All I ever did was look at him.</i></b>

12:40.990 --> 12:44.360
<b><i>And the whole time, I was just scared.</i></b>

12:46.240 --> 12:47.620
<b><i>It's nothing.</i></b>

12:48.450 --> 12:52.160
<b><i>It's just that I lack courage
and can't make a move.</i></b>

12:52.710 --> 12:56.460
<b>THERE'S NOTHING
YOU CAN TELL ME?</b>

12:53.960 --> 12:56.460
<b>NO COURAGE?</b>

12:54.710 --> 12:56.460
<b>CAN'T MOVE?</b>

12:56.880 --> 13:00.170
<b>Um... I'm not sure what it's all about,</b>

13:00.170 --> 13:03.090
<b>but why don't you start...
by making a move?</b>

13:03.130 --> 13:07.890
<b>ALL DONE</b>

13:03.550 --> 13:07.340
<b>If there's something you want to do,
then why don't you just do it?</b>

13:08.300 --> 13:11.180
<b>You can't just wait
for courage and motivation to well up!</b>

13:11.680 --> 13:13.640
<b>You need to make a move first!</b>

13:13.930 --> 13:16.150
<b>If there's something you want to change...</b>

13:21.610 --> 13:24.650
<b>So... oh, hey, look at the time!</b>

13:25.360 --> 13:28.120
<b>Sorry I went on and on. You must be wiped.</b>

13:28.620 --> 13:31.910
<b><i>Yes. My hand got so numb,
I switched to Bluetooth.</i></b>

13:32.080 --> 13:33.410
<b><i>Talk about honest.</i></b>

13:33.750 --> 13:36.420
<b>What was your question again?</b>

13:36.920 --> 13:37.920
<b><i>Oh...</i></b>

13:38.460 --> 13:41.130
<b>Right, it wasn't so much a question...</b>

13:42.670 --> 13:44.670
<b><i>as me wanting to hear your voice.</i></b>

13:45.470 --> 13:46.430
<b>That's all!</b>

13:46.760 --> 13:47.590
<b><i>Bye now!</i></b>

13:52.220 --> 13:55.140
<b>AKANE</b>

13:56.890 --> 13:58.900
<b><i>My hands...</i></b>

14:00.310 --> 14:01.230
<b><i>are trembling.</i></b>

14:09.410 --> 14:12.240
<b>Hey, Momo? Thanks for today.</b>

14:12.740 --> 14:13.830
<b>Can you talk now?</b>

14:14.750 --> 14:16.500
<b>Yeah, see...</b>

14:17.670 --> 14:21.500
<b>there's something
I want to talk to you about!</b>

14:24.000 --> 14:25.970
<b>MOMO
I'll contact you again</b>

14:24.000 --> 14:26.550
<b>Got it
I'll be waiting.</b>

14:24.000 --> 14:27.170
<b>Let's meet tomorrow
There's a cafe I want to go to,
so can we meet there?
I'll send you a map
Let's meet at 11:00!</b>

14:24.920 --> 14:29.090
<b>Received location
Tap to open the map</b>

14:25.460 --> 14:28.800
<b>Okay!</b>

14:27.170 --> 14:29.090
<b>There's a cafe I want to go to,
so can we meet there?
I'll send you a map
Let's meet at 11:00!</b>

14:37.140 --> 14:38.230
<b>This is it, huh?</b>

14:40.310 --> 14:42.770
<b>CUTE</b>

14:40.940 --> 14:42.770
<b>I never knew there was a place like this.</b>

14:50.950 --> 14:55.660
<b>So anyway, about that thing I wanted
to ask you over the phone the other day...</b>

14:55.660 --> 14:58.120
<b>Why do you think... uh...</b>

14:58.870 --> 15:00.420
<b>Why did I get dumped?</b>

15:04.670 --> 15:06.510
<b>May I take your order?</b>

15:06.510 --> 15:09.680
<b>I'll have the fluffy soufflé pancakes
and an iced tea.</b>

15:10.380 --> 15:11.840
<b>And she'll just have water!</b>

15:12.050 --> 15:12.890
<b>So mean!</b>

15:16.810 --> 15:18.390
<b>I'll have the same thing!</b>

15:18.390 --> 15:20.810
<b>Two orders of pancakes
and iced teas, right?</b>

15:23.310 --> 15:26.440
<b>Akane? I'm disappointed in you.</b>

15:26.440 --> 15:27.480
<b>Why?</b>

15:27.360 --> 15:37.580
<b>FINALLY!</b>

15:27.480 --> 15:29.490
<b><i>There's something
I want to talk to you about!</i></b>

15:29.490 --> 15:30.320
<b>Really?</b>

15:30.320 --> 15:32.990
<b>Hold up, hold up! I want to see you
and talk to you in person!</b>

15:32.990 --> 15:34.450
<b>A sit-down, meaningful chat!</b>

15:35.120 --> 15:39.710
<b>While I waited a whole week for you
to make a full recovery from your cold,</b>

15:39.710 --> 15:41.620
<b>Momo hasn't been able to focus.</b>

15:41.620 --> 15:44.420
<b>All I could manage
was three group dates.</b>

15:44.920 --> 15:46.880
<b>Yet now that I'm
hearing from you,</b>

15:46.880 --> 15:50.930
<b>you've shattered my fantasies and
started with a totally lame line.</b>

15:50.930 --> 15:52.010
<b>I'm so disappointed.</b>

15:51.630 --> 15:55.010
<b>LAME</b>

15:52.010 --> 15:55.010
<b>Three group dates in a week
sounds like full throttle, doesn't it?</b>

15:55.640 --> 16:00.810
<b>GRR!</b>

15:55.930 --> 15:58.810
<b>Here I was
expecting to hear some fun girl talk!</b>

15:58.270 --> 16:00.810
<b>NOW, NOW...</b>

15:58.810 --> 16:00.810
<b>Hey, hear me out, will you?</b>

16:02.770 --> 16:05.900
<b>Lately, something's been on my mind.</b>

16:06.860 --> 16:08.530
<b>And I can't really...</b>

16:08.530 --> 16:10.740
<b>You know, in a romantic sense.</b>

16:10.740 --> 16:12.950
<b>In order to move on...</b>

16:13.450 --> 16:17.910
<b>If I have any major flaws,
I'd like to fix them, you know?</b>

16:18.370 --> 16:22.250
<b>Like, maybe I don't realize it myself,
but I have a really bad habit!</b>

16:21.870 --> 16:23.540
<b>SINCE I CAN'T TELL MYSELF
IF I HAVE ONE!</b>

16:22.250 --> 16:23.540
<b>Why so many questions?</b>

16:23.790 --> 16:27.460
<b>It's like, no matter who I
fall in love with, I've got to fix it.</b>

16:27.460 --> 16:30.460
<b>When I think that it might be
a fatal flaw, it scares me.</b>

16:30.460 --> 16:31.920
<b>Well, you don't have one.</b>

16:31.920 --> 16:39.930
<b>REGRET...</b>

16:32.420 --> 16:36.600
<b>If I knew I was going to agonize
about it after the fact,</b>

16:36.600 --> 16:39.930
<b>even if it would have been embarrassing,
I should have asked Takuma.</b>

16:40.100 --> 16:45.060
<b>NOT THAT...</b>

16:40.350 --> 16:42.560
<b>No, that's not...</b>

16:43.480 --> 16:44.770
<b>Welcome!</b>

16:46.360 --> 16:47.190
<b>Hey...</b>

16:47.980 --> 16:50.070
<b>E-Excuse me, sir.</b>

16:48.940 --> 16:51.820
<b>I thought I saw a knockout,
and it was you, Momo!</b>

16:51.990 --> 16:52.820
<b>Ugh!</b>

16:52.820 --> 16:54.820
<b>Hey, what a coincidence!</b>

16:54.990 --> 16:56.950
<b>Uh, let me show you to your—</b>

16:55.160 --> 16:56.240
<b>Wh-Who are they?</b>

16:56.240 --> 16:58.700
<b>I was at a group date with them
the day before yesterday.</b>

16:56.950 --> 16:58.450
<b>Oh, I'll just sit with them.</b>

16:58.450 --> 17:02.830
<b>I'd like to show you
to your seats over here.</b>

16:58.700 --> 17:02.830
<b>They're super pesky and
super touchy-feely, so I left right away.</b>

17:03.000 --> 17:05.830
<b>How can you go on group dates
with guys like them?</b>

17:05.830 --> 17:08.170
<b>Well, a friend of a friend introduced us.</b>

17:08.500 --> 17:10.050
<b>Can we share this table with you?</b>

17:10.050 --> 17:12.050
<b>No way! No way! No way! No way!</b>

17:12.050 --> 17:14.170
<b>Hey, hello there, Momo's friend!</b>

17:15.010 --> 17:17.680
<b>I'm really sorry.
Momo will deal with them,</b>

17:17.680 --> 17:19.180
<b>so Akane can just ignore them.</b>

17:20.680 --> 17:22.850
<b>Aren't you being a little pushy?</b>

17:22.850 --> 17:24.440
<b>Momo doesn't know what to do!</b>

17:24.440 --> 17:27.770
<b>I know, we're making so much trouble
for you. Both of us!</b>

17:28.270 --> 17:31.530
<b>Momo! You skipped out on paying
for your drinks the other day, didn't you?</b>

17:31.530 --> 17:34.860
<b>Huh? I gave it to the organizer.</b>

17:34.860 --> 17:37.070
<b>Really? That's news to me!</b>

17:37.070 --> 17:39.580
<b>Did you check with her yourself?</b>

17:39.580 --> 17:43.830
<b>Oh, who cares about a few drinks?
Let's all get along now, huh?</b>

17:43.830 --> 17:47.460
<b><i>Hmm, they're not going anywhere soon,
are they?</i></b>

17:47.580 --> 17:49.750
<b>Momo, you smell awesome, don't you?</b>

17:49.750 --> 17:51.380
<b>No way! No way! Personal space!</b>

17:51.380 --> 17:52.420
<b>H-Hey!</b>

17:52.420 --> 17:54.050
<b>Thank you for waiting.</b>

17:55.380 --> 17:58.800
<b>You ordered the fluffy soufflé pancakes
and iced tea, right?</b>

18:00.300 --> 18:01.140
<b>Huh?</b>

18:01.640 --> 18:05.020
<b>Wait, were there four of you
in your party?</b>

18:05.020 --> 18:06.350
<b>E-Eita!</b>

18:06.350 --> 18:08.150
<b>Sasaki! Actually, this table is—</b>

18:11.270 --> 18:12.110
<b>Oh, my.</b>

18:12.940 --> 18:15.150
<b>Yeah, we know these girls!</b>

18:15.150 --> 18:16.650
<b>So don't give it another thought!</b>

18:18.530 --> 18:21.780
<b>OHH, EITA,
PLEASE SAVE US</b>

18:18.530 --> 18:21.780
<b>GUILD MEMBER'S GAZE</b>

18:20.280 --> 18:21.780
<b>- Oh!
- Oh!</b>

18:22.410 --> 18:27.670
<b>Sirs, I apologize, but you're
inconveniencing these other customers,</b>

18:22.660 --> 18:30.420
<b>EEK</b>

18:27.670 --> 18:30.080
<b>so allow me to show you
to a different table!</b>

18:30.080 --> 18:32.210
<b>We're fine right here!</b>

18:36.010 --> 18:41.220
<b>Sirs, I apologize, but you're
inconveniencing these other customers,</b>

18:41.220 --> 18:43.430
<b>so please move to another table.</b>

18:44.060 --> 18:45.180
<b>No, but we're—</b>

18:45.180 --> 18:48.140
<b>Thank you for your cooperation.</b>

18:48.390 --> 18:49.810
<b>- Uh...
- Uh...</b>

18:53.650 --> 18:55.320
<b>Thank you, Eita!</b>

18:55.480 --> 18:56.610
<b>What a coincidence, huh?</b>

18:56.610 --> 18:59.200
<b>What a surprise! I had no idea!</b>

18:59.200 --> 19:00.820
<b>Well, I sure noticed!</b>

19:00.820 --> 19:02.990
<b>What? Then say so!</b>

19:02.990 --> 19:05.120
<b>Well, keeping quiet was more amusing!</b>

19:03.950 --> 19:05.120
<b><i>You know each other?</i></b>

19:05.580 --> 19:09.710
<b>E-Excuse me.
I'm sorry to have caused trouble here.</b>

19:11.880 --> 19:12.710
<b>No worries.</b>

19:15.880 --> 19:18.090
<b>Man, what a shock.</b>

19:18.340 --> 19:20.840
<b>Thank goodness Eita was there!</b>

19:20.840 --> 19:22.970
<b>How good-looking was that guy?</b>

19:24.430 --> 19:26.680
<b>Eita's another of my guildmates!</b>

19:26.680 --> 19:27.600
<b><i>Aww!</i></b>

19:27.600 --> 19:29.270
<b>Huh? Him, too?</b>

19:29.520 --> 19:31.560
<b>That's right. He's our master.</b>

19:40.700 --> 19:44.450
<b>This game that you're playing
is dreamier than my group dates.</b>

19:44.330 --> 19:48.870
<b>I DON'T KNOW
ABOUT THAT...</b>

19:44.740 --> 19:47.330
<b>You know what,
I'm starting to feel hopeless.</b>

19:56.840 --> 20:00.130
<b>Momo, about what I
was talking about earlier...</b>

20:00.630 --> 20:01.550
<b>Huh?</b>

20:05.140 --> 20:07.140
<b>Good work!</b>

20:07.140 --> 20:12.520
<b>KEEP THINGS TIDY AND IN ORDER</b>

20:07.640 --> 20:08.850
<b>Good work!</b>

20:08.850 --> 20:10.980
<b>Sasaki, do you have a second?</b>

20:10.980 --> 20:12.020
<b>What? No.</b>

20:12.900 --> 20:15.270
<b>Because I'm off the clock now.</b>

20:15.270 --> 20:17.150
<b>It's not about work.</b>

20:17.650 --> 20:21.570
<b>I'm going to go to karaoke
with the daytime staff. Come with me!</b>

20:21.570 --> 20:23.910
<b>Since you helped me out earlier,
it's my treat.</b>

20:25.120 --> 20:27.990
<b>My kid sister's waiting for me
to come home, so I can't.</b>

20:27.990 --> 20:30.000
<b>HMPH</b>

20:28.290 --> 20:29.120
<b>Sister complex.</b>

20:29.120 --> 20:30.000
<b>How rude.</b>

20:30.620 --> 20:33.790
<b>I merely love her a bit excessively.
In other words, sister complex.</b>

20:33.790 --> 20:34.960
<b>You just admitted it.</b>

20:35.630 --> 20:37.500
<b>SASAKI</b>

20:36.090 --> 20:37.500
<b>Good work!</b>

20:42.970 --> 20:43.930
<b>Hey, Eita!</b>

20:45.720 --> 20:47.970
<b>Huh? You're both still here?</b>

20:48.470 --> 20:50.890
<b>What are you doing in a place like this?</b>

20:51.390 --> 20:53.270
<b>We were waiting for you, Eita.</b>

20:53.480 --> 20:55.270
<b>Oh, my, like groupies?</b>

20:53.480 --> 20:56.900
<b>NOOOO</b>

20:55.270 --> 20:56.900
<b><i>Huh?
Mysterious character...</i></b>

21:02.570 --> 21:03.780
<b>Huh?</b>

21:05.910 --> 21:08.370
<b>There's something
I want to talk to you about.</b>

21:08.370 --> 21:09.490
<b>Do you mind?</b>

22:45.050 --> 22:47.090
<b>Okay, want to get going?</b>

22:47.090 --> 22:49.260
<b>Is everyone's equipment okay?</b>

22:49.260 --> 22:50.930
<b>- Yes.
- Yes.</b>

22:51.550 --> 22:53.100
<b><i>I have to show her what I'm made of!</i></b>

22:53.850 --> 22:54.680
<b>Huh?</b>

22:55.980 --> 22:57.140
<b><i>Equipment...</i></b>

22:59.060 --> 23:03.480
<b>SEARCHING FOR EQUIPMENT</b>

23:05.650 --> 23:09.320
<b>Actually, is your gear
different than mine, TSUBAKI?</b>

23:16.330 --> 23:18.830
<b>Wow, it's so cool! Rare equipment?</b>

23:18.910 --> 23:21.830
<b>ANYONE CAN
GET THEM BY ADVANCING
IN THE MAIN QUEST</b>

23:19.250 --> 23:20.710
<b>N-No.</b>

23:22.000 --> 23:24.670
<b>Hey, how did you acquire those?</b>

23:24.670 --> 23:26.210
<b>It's not like I acquired them.</b>

23:26.210 --> 23:27.420
<b>The first quest—</b>

23:27.420 --> 23:28.840
<b>Right, right! Go on.</b>

23:29.430 --> 23:32.090
<b><i>Actually, since you leveled up
your initial gear to the max,</i></b>

23:32.090 --> 23:35.010
<b><i>yours is the super-rare one, Akanecchi!</i></b>

23:35.010 --> 23:38.020
<b>LUCKY YOU</b>

23:37.520 --> 23:38.020
<b>MAXED-OUT
BEGINNER'S ARMOR</b>

23:38.020 --> 23:38.520
<b>MAXED-OUT
GRAPHICS CARD</b>
